      "wasDerivedFrom": "paper",
      "mls:description": "A neural model that performs document-level IE tasks jointly. It uses SciBERT+BiLSTM for document representation, a CRF for mention identification, a classifier for saliency, and a clustering approach for coreference and relation extraction.",
      "mls:architecture": "SciBERT + BiLSTM + CRF + Clustering",
